{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:094ea612f1db1af8","name":"Squad Leadership Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-094ea612f1db1af8","title":"Squad Leadership Talent Tree","revision":20956,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:52:33Z","sha256":"576535c1157eb6a04b8d59d1a299020a1295067ee426f01f2b4537faed8cb5c4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20956","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Squad%20Leadership%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-094ea612f1db1af8","blocks":[{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Squad Leader Talent Tree in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Squad Leader Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Squad_Leader_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:25736b2013cc8a18"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are an expert at small-unit tactics, leading a small group of allies into battle as a cohesive unit.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All Talents in the Squad Leadership Talent Tree apply to other characters in a squad you command. A squad includes yourself plus a number of characters equal to or less than the sum of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Elite Trooper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Elite_Trooper","referenceId":"reference:02fa86cb25e21540"}," Class Level plus your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," modifier (minimum of one other character). These characters must be on foot, must have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to you, and must be able to communicate with you to gain the benefit of your Squad Leadership Talents. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", you designate which characters are in your squad at the beginning of your first turn.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each squad can benefit from the Talents of only a single squad leader, designated when an encounter begins. A character without a squad leader can join an existing squad if both character and squad leader are willing and if the squad leader has not reached his or her maximum squad size.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Fall Back"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", you can enable each member of your squad to immediately ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," 2 squares. This movement does not provoke an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Form Up"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", you give all squad members a +2 morale bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the end of your next turn, as long as they are within 6 squares of another squad member.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Full Advance"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", you give all squad members a +2 morale bonus to damage rolls until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hold Steady"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you move all members of your squad +1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Search and Destroy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", you give all squad members a +2 morale bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
